which sounds like a polite way

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.400
of saying third nipple.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:20.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.434 --> 00:03:23.200
Well, what?

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:25.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.400
This is odd though --
Biden's actually gotten taller.

00:03:27.400 --> 00:03:29.067
This is true.
He's actually gotten taller

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:31.267
since his physical a year ago.

00:03:31.267 --> 00:03:34.367
Forget the UFOs. I want to know
how an 80-year-old grew.

00:03:34.367 --> 00:03:36.634
What's going on?

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:38.334
Got taller.

00:03:38.334 --> 00:03:40.400
[ Applause ]

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.801
And everyone's still talking
about this.

00:03:41.801 --> 00:03:44.434
Last weekend,
the U.S. shot down three UFOs,

00:03:44.434 --> 00:03:45.868
