Bottle Cap Balloon Brigade.

00:03:52.667 --> 00:03:54.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.934
So it looks like we've made
a very powerful enemy.

00:03:56.934 --> 00:03:58.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.701 --> 00:04:00.801
Yep, all this week, people have
been talking about the U.S.

00:04:00.801 --> 00:04:02.701
