00:04:02.701 --> 00:04:04.167
It feels like we're in
the middle of a --

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:05.834
-I want to shoot me a UFO.

00:04:07.934 --> 00:04:09.267
-Excuse me? Excuse me?

00:04:09.267 --> 00:04:12.167
-I said, I want to shoot me
a UFO.

00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:13.934
Why's the government get to have
all the fun?

00:04:13.934 --> 00:04:16.033
I got me great aim
with my slingshot.

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:18.234
[ Mimics firing ]

00:04:18.234 --> 00:04:20.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.934 --> 00:04:24.000
-You think you can shoot down
a UFO with a slingshot?

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.434
-I know I can.
I gotta use my slingshot.

00:04:26.434 --> 00:04:28.968
I just got it back
from my teacher.

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:30.801
-Your teacher?
How old are you?

00:04:30.801 --> 00:04:32.901
-45.

00:04:32.901 --> 00:04:34.300
-You're still in school?

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:37.234
-Yep. My teacher took
my slingshot in first grade,

00:04:37.234 --> 00:04:39.667
and I had to re-enroll
in elementary school

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:42.100
to get it back.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.133
