re-enrolling in the first grade?

00:04:47.234 --> 00:04:48.834
Or buy a new one?

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:50.934
-I don't like your tone, Fallon.

00:04:50.934 --> 00:04:52.701
Eat rock.

00:04:52.701 --> 00:04:53.901
-Ow.

00:04:53.901 --> 00:04:55.167
[ Laughter ]

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:58.968
-[ Laughs ] You see,
I told you I got great aim.

00:04:58.968 --> 00:05:03.567
I just hit a UFMF, unidentified
flying mother [bleep].

00:05:03.567 --> 00:05:05.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:06.701
-This crazy.
Get him out of here.

00:05:06.701 --> 00:05:09.467
Get this guy out of here.
Let's get this guy out --

00:05:09.467 --> 00:05:12.667
-I'll be back, Fallon.
You ain't seen the last of me.

00:05:12.667 --> 00:05:14.501
-What the hell is --
What the hell is wrong?

00:05:14.501 --> 00:05:17.501
You can't talk like that.
-Oh, my God.

00:05:17.501 --> 00:05:20.634
That guy is rude
and had a foul mouth.

00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:21.868
-Yes.
-A foul mouth.

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:23.300
-This is a family show.
Who is that guy?

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.901
Get him out of here.
-Geez Louise.

00:05:24.901 --> 00:05:26.501
