00:05:26.501 --> 00:05:27.767
-Some business news here, guys.

00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:31.000
I saw that the CEO of
YouTube is stepping down.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.534
Yup, when employees heard,
they were like, "First."

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:37.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:37.067 --> 00:05:38.434
