00:07:16.267 --> 00:07:20.100
For example, Adidas is actually
pronounced adi-daas.

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.467
It's true.

00:07:21.467 --> 00:07:23.601
And IKEA should be pronounced
"e-kay-uh."

00:07:23.601 --> 00:07:26.801
-Pfft. Come on. I already knew
that. I knew that.

00:07:26.801 --> 00:07:29.868
-Sorry, Higgins. You knew how
