me -- give me some hard ones.

00:07:55.267 --> 00:07:56.601
Rapid-fire them.
-Rapid fire.

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:58.467
Okay, here we go. What's this?

00:07:58.467 --> 00:07:59.534
